hov-qt (1.2.1-2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * License metadata fix: declare GPL-3.0-only. The repository LICENSE
    grants version 3 of the GPL without the "or later" option; the
    earlier or-later statement was an over-declaration. Aligns with
    the Arch/AUR packaging.

